# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is PUBLIC and must contain no credentials or personal identifiers.
# Everything below stays local. Do not remove these entries.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Router backups: contain etc/shadow (root password hash),
# etc/tailscale/tailscaled.state (private machine key), and all WiFi PSKs.
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Readable config dumps: WiFi keys in plaintext.
config-snapshot/

# Build record and local inventory: public IPs, tailnet name,
# Tailscale addresses, hostnames, guest password.
SETUP-LOG.md
LOCAL-README.md

# Anything explicitly marked local or secret.
*.local
*.secret
*-private.*
